A word with two meanings would mean "ambiguity" (bad).  A word with an
extremely broad definition or a word whose meaning draws from the local
context would mean "vagueness" (good).

Given those definitions, I don'tthink lojban has any ambiguous words but
very many words are vague.

So "ge'e" maybe?  That might be too vague for your needs though
